    why: "Values are substituted only where the agent never sees them: MCP arguments through the gateway, a shell command the firewall can rewrite into a ticketed run (agents verified to rewrite tool input: Claude Code), and run --env. A reference in a WebFetch URL or search query, inside single quotes, a here-document or a computed word, in a part of a command that sends nothing (echo, tee), for an agent that cannot rewrite tool input, or to an MCP server not behind the gateway is denied with a hint to use run --env, rather than letting the reference text go out.",
